<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Oil Search says gets Gobe go-ahead.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Oil Search says gets Gobe go-ahead.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oil Search Ltd said on Friday the Gobe joint venture received the necessary government licenses to commence development of the Gobe oil field in Papua New Guinea.</p>
<p>&quot;The Papua New Guinea Mining and Petroleum Minister, John Giheno, issued on December 24 1996 the two Gobe Development Licenses and the Gobe Pipeline License,&quot; Oil Search said in a statement to the Australian Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>As a result, construction is expected to start almost immediately, with an aim to bring the project on stream in the first quarter of 1998, the company said.</p>
</text>
